entity.sf4angel.angel.name=Angel Guide
sf4angel.angel.spawn=The Angel descends...
sf4angel.angel.greeting=I am your guide through the sky.
sf4angel.angel.farewell=Until next time, builder.
sf4angel.angel.death=The Angel reclaims what was lost...
sf4angel.angel.attack=Do NOT strike me. The heavens will answer.
sf4angel.angel.idle=The sky is vast. You are not yet worthy of it.
sf4angel.angel.sacrifice=An offering? How thoughtful. Here is my advice instead.
sf4angel.angel.health_low=You are dying. I can see it.
sf4angel.angel.advancement=The heavens celebrate your progress!
sf4angel.angel.age_new=Another age conquered. Impressive. For a mortal.

advancements.sf4angel.root.title=The Sky Begins
advancements.sf4angel.root.desc=You have arrived in the sky. The angel watches.
advancements.sf4angel.plant_sapling.title=First Growth
advancements.sf4angel.plant_sapling.desc=Plant a sapling on dirt. Everything begins there.
advancements.sf4angel.cobble_gen.title=Infinite Stone
advancements.sf4angel.cobble_gen.desc=Build a cobblestone generator. The foundation of civilization.
advancements.sf4angel.first_sieve.title=Shake the Sky
advancements.sf4angel.first_sieve.desc=Craft and use a sieve. Resources hide within gravel.
advancements.sf4angel.iron_age.title=Iron Will
advancements.sf4angel.iron_age.desc=Obtain iron. The sky bends to stronger materials.
advancements.sf4angel.gold_discovery.title=Gilded Fortune
advancements.sf4angel.gold_discovery.desc=Find gold. Precious, but you need more.
advancements.sf4angel.diamond_find.title=The Deep Sparkle
advancements.sf4angel.diamond_find.desc=Discover a diamond. Even the sky has treasures.
advancements.sf4angel.first_tree_farm.title=Forest Keeper
advancements.sf4angel.first_tree_farm.desc=Automate tree farming. Nature bows to industry.
advancements.sf4angel.bonsai_trio.title=Bonsai Master
advancements.sf4angel.bonsai_trio.desc=Set up three bonsai pots. Small trees, huge potential.
advancements.sf4angel.all_saplings.title=Arbor Collector
advancements.sf4angel.all_saplings.desc=Collect every tree sapling type. The sky demands variety.
advancements.sf4angel.animal_crops.title=Animal Whisperer
advancements.sf4angel.animal_crops.desc=Breed an animal from Animal Crops. Life finds a way.
advancements.sf4angel.resource_hog.title=Piggy Bank
advancements.sf4angel.resource_hog.desc=Breed a Resource Hog. Free resources forever.
advancements.sf4angel.market_shopping.title=The Merchant
advancements.sf4angel.market_shopping.desc=Buy your first item from the Market. Commerce is king.
advancements.sf4angel.wheat_empire.title=Wheat King
advancements.sf4angel.wheat_empire.desc=Grow 64 wheat. The sky hungers.
advancements.sf4angel.nether_wart.title=Fire Crop
advancements.sf4angel.nether_wart.desc=Grow Nether Wart. Even hellish plants need sky soil.
advancements.sf4angel.watering_can.title=Hydration Station
advancements.sf4angel.watering_can.desc=Craft a Watering Can. Water is life in the void.
advancements.sf4angel.mulch.title=Soil Science
advancements.sf4angel.mulch.desc=Create Mulch. The earth thanks you.
advancements.sf4angel.fertile_soil.title=Garden of the Sky
advancements.sf4angel.fertile_soil.desc=Convert dirt to Fertile Soil. Now things grow faster.
advancements.sf4angel.sky_orchards.title=Orchard Architect
advancements.sf4angel.sky_orchards.desc=Complete a Sky Orchard tree cycle. Nature industrialized.
advancements.sf4angel.tinker_smeltery.title=Forge of Creation
advancements.sf4angel.tinker_smeltery.desc=Build a Tinkers Construct smeltery. Shape metal to your will.
advancements.sf4angel.first_manyullyn.title=Manyullyn Mastery
advancements.sf4angel.first_manyullyn.desc=Smelt Manyullyn. The strongest alloy in the sky.
advancements.sf4angel.tool_modifier.title=Tool Evolution
advancements.sf4angel.tool_modifier.desc=Apply 5 modifiers to one tool. Every edge needs honing.
advancements.sf4angel.diamond_mesh.title=Mesh Upgrade
advancements.sf4angel.diamond_mesh.desc=Craft a Diamond Mesh. The sieve reveals its secrets.
advancements.sf4angel.enchanting_table.title=Arcane Study
advancements.sf4angel.enchanting_table.desc=Build an Enchanting Table. Knowledge has a price.
advancements.sf4angel.level_30_enchant.title=Maximum Power
advancements.sf4angel.level_30_enchant.desc=Enchant at level 30. The sky trembles with energy.
advancements.sf4angel.glitch_helmet.title=Glitch Protocol
advancements.sf4angel.glitch_helmet.desc=Craft Glitch Armor helmet. Reality bends to protect you.
advancements.sf4angel.full_glitch.title=Glitch Ascension
advancements.sf4angel.full_glitch.desc=Wear a full Glitch Armor set. You are beyond mortal.
advancements.sf4angel.deep_mob_learning.title=Digital Souls
advancements.sf4angel.deep_mob_learning.desc=Build a Simulation Chamber. Mob data is power.
advancements.sf4angel.data_model_train.title=Data Harvest
advancements.sf4angel.data_model_train.desc=Train a data model to pristine. Knowledge is violence.
advancements.sf4angel.basic_generator.title=First Spark
advancements.sf4angel.basic_generator.desc=Build your first generator. The sky finally has power.
advancements.rf_over_10k.title=Power Surge
advancements.rf_over_10k.desc=Generate 10,000 RF in one tick. Energy flows through you.
advancements.rf_over_100k.title=Lightning in a Bottle
advancements.rf_over_100k.desc=Generate 100,000 RF. You are becoming something more.
advancements.mekanism_factory.title=Mekanism Rising
advancements.mekanism_factory.desc=Build a Mekanism factory. Atom by atom, you rebuild the sky.
advancements.mekanism_ore_3x.title=Triple Yield
advancements.mekanism_ore_3x.desc=Process ore 3x. Efficiency is divine.
advancements.nuclear_reactor.title=Split Decision
advancements.nuclear_reactor.desc=Build a NuclearCraft reactor. Handle with extreme care.
advancements.fusion_reactor.title=Star Maker
advancements.fusion_reactor.desc=Build a fusion reactor. You wield a star.
advancements.rftools_powercell.title=RF Network
advancements.rftools_powercell.desc=Build an RFTools powercell network. Power without wires.
advancements.rftools_dimension.title=Reality Weaver
advancements.rftools_dimension.desc=Create an RFTools dimension. You define existence now.
advancements.simple_storage.title=Network Mind
advancements.simple_storage.desc=Build a Simple Storage Network. Every item, one click.
advancements.ae2_controller.title=Digital God
advancements.ae2_controller.desc=Build an AE2 ME Controller. The sky goes digital.
advancements.ae2_autocraft.title=Auto Artisan
advancements.ae2_autocraft.desc=Set up AE2 autocrafting. Machines think for you.
advancements.storage_50k.title=Hoarder Supreme
advancements.storage_50k.desc=Store 50,000 items. The sky bows to your collection.
advancements.barrel_empire.title=Barrel Baron
advancements.barrel_empire.desc=Fill 50 drawers with different items. Order from chaos.
advancements.nether_gateway.title=Hell Gate
advancements.nether_gateway.desc=Enter the Nether. Fire and brimstone await.
advancements.ender_dragon_kill.title=Dragon Slayer
advancements.ender_dragon_kill.desc=Defeat the Ender Dragon. The sky has a new apex predator.
advancements.twilight_enter.title=Between Worlds
advancements.twilight_enter.desc=Enter the Twilight Forest. Another reality, another challenge.
advancements.twilight_lich.title=Lich King Down
advancements.twilight_lich.desc=Defeat the Lich. Death cannot hold you here either.
advancements.twilight_hydra.title=Hydra Hunter
advancements.twilight_hydra.desc=Defeat the Hydra. Cut one head, two more appear.
advancements.lost_cities_explore.title=Urban Archaeologist
advancements.lost_cities_explore.desc=Explore 5 Lost City buildings. Civilization left its mark.
advancements.compact_machine.title=Box Within a Box
advancements.compact_machine.desc=Enter a Compact Machine. A dimension in a block.
advancements.wither_kill.title=Star Maker Slayer
advancements.wither_kill.desc=Defeat the Wither. The Nether Star is yours.
advancements.beacon_build.title=Beacon of Hope
advancements.beacon_build.desc=Build a Beacon. The sky acknowledges your power.
advancements.singularity.title=Universal Compression
advancements.singularity.desc=Craft a Singularity. 4096 items become one.
advancements.max_reactor.title=Maximum Overdrive
advancements.max_reactor.desc=Build the largest possible reactor. The sky trembles.
advancements.collectible_10.title=Treasure Hunter
advancements.collectible_10.desc=Collect 10 collectibles. The sky rewards the curious.
advancements.collectible_all.title=Completionist
advancements.collectible_all.desc=Collect every collectible. You own the sky now.
advancements.elytra_get.title=Wings of the Sky
advancements.elytra_get.desc=Find Elytra. The sky is yours to fly.
advancements.prestige_1.title=Prestige Begin
advancements.prestige_1.desc=Earn your first Prestige Point. The cycle begins again.
advancements.prestige_all.title=Sky Legend
advancements.prestige_all.desc=Earn all Prestige Points. The sky remembers you forever.
advancements.sky_factory_complete.title=Your Place Among Stars
advancements.sky_factory_complete.desc=Complete Sky Factory 4. You are the sky.
advancements.kill_100_mobs.title=Sky Exterminator
advancements.kill_100_mobs.desc=Kill 100 mobs. The void was never safe.
advancements.mine_1000_blocks.title=Sky Miner
advancements.mine_1000_blocks.desc=Mine 1000 blocks. Every block is a step forward.
advancements.play_10_hours.title=Dedicated Soul
advancements.play_10_hours.desc=Play for 10 hours. The sky is your home now.
advancements.play_50_hours.title=Sky Dweller
advancements.play_50_hours.desc=Play for 50 hours. You have become one with the void.
advancements.play_100_hours.title=Angel's Companion
advancements.play_100_hours.desc=Play for 100 hours. The angel considers you a friend.
advancements.first_death.title=Sky Falls
advancements.first_death.desc=Die for the first time. The sky is unforgiving.
advancements.death_10.title=Persistent Spirit
advancements.death_10.desc=Die 10 times. Death is merely a inconvenience.
advancements.death_50.title=Immortal Fool
advancements.death_50.desc=Die 50 times. The angel weeps for your clumsiness.
advancements.cook_everything.title=Sky Chef
advancements.cook_everything.desc=Cook every food type. Even in the sky, you must eat.
advancements.full_inventory.title=Packed Tight
advancements.full_inventory.desc=Fill your entire inventory. The sky has too much stuff.
advancements.max_enchant_everything.title=Enchant Overlord
advancements.max_enchant_everything.desc=Enchant 10 items to max level. The arcane bows to you.
advancements.twilight_all_bosses.title=Twilight Conqueror
advancements.twilight_all_bosses.desc=Defeat all Twilight Forest bosses. Another dimension conquered.
advancements.void_crossing.title=Void Walker
advancements.void_crossing.desc=Fall into the void and survive. The sky tried to kill you.
advancements.flying_enabled.title=Sky Dancer
advancements.flying_enabled.desc=Enable flight for the first time. Wings of your own making.
advancements.deep_sky.title=Deep Sky
advancements.deep_sky.desc=Reach the deepest point of the void. What lies below?
advancements.sky_builder_100.title=Architect of the Void
advancements.sky_builder_100.desc=Place 100 building blocks. You shape the sky.
advancements.sky_builder_1000.title=Sky Architect
advancements.sky_builder_1000.desc=Place 1000 building blocks. The sky bends to your vision.
advancements.redstone_engineer.title=Redstone Savant
advancements.redstone_engineer.desc=Use 100 redstone dust. Logic flows through the sky.
advancements.automation_king.title=Machine Overlord
advancements.automation_king.desc=Automate 5 different machines. You no longer work. Machines do.
advancements.mob_killer_boss.title=Apex Predator
advancements.mob_killer_boss.desc=Kill a boss mob. The sky has a new ruler.
advancements.food_variety.title=Sky Gourmet
advancements.food_variety.desc=Eat 20 different food types. Even angels envy your diet.
advancements.ender_pearl_hoard.title=Ender Collector
advancements.ender_pearl_hoard.desc=Collect 64 Ender Pearls. The End calls to you.
advancements.blaze_farm.title=Inferno Farmer
advancements.blaze_farm.desc=Build a Blaze farm. Fire is your resource now.
advancements.obsidian_factory.title=Obsidian Press
advancements.obsidian_factory.desc=Produce 64 obsidian automatically. The void materializes.
advancements.golden_apples.title=Forbidden Fruit
advancements.golden_apples.desc=Craft a Golden Apple. Immortality in apple form.
advancements.sky_dragon.title=Sky Dragon
advancements.sky_dragon.desc=Summon and defeat a phantom. Even airborne foes fall.
advancements.crafting_master.title=Crafting Savant
advancements.crafting_master.desc=Craft 1000 items. Your hands know the recipes by heart.
advancements.furnace_meltdown.title=Meltdown
advancements.furnace_meltdown.desc=Use 1000 fuel in furnaces. Fire never sleeps in the sky.
advancements.animal_army.title=Noah's Sky
advancements.animal_army.desc=Breed 50 animals. The sky is a living place now.
advancements.redstone_clock.title=Tick Tock
advancements.redstone_clock.desc=Build a redstone clock. Time itself bends to your will.
advancements.auto_sieve.title=Hands Free
advancements.auto_sieve.desc=Fully automate a sieve. Never shake again.
advancements.resource_monopoly.title=Resource Baron
advancements.resource_monopoly.desc=Have 1000 of any single resource. Abundance is power.
advancements.sky_explorer.title=Sky Voyager
advancements.sky_explorer.desc=Visit every dimension at least once. The multiverse is your playground.
advancements.angel_friend.title=Angel's Blessing
advancements.angel_friend.desc=Have the angel appear 50 times. You are the angel's favorite.
advancements.angel_strike_first.title=Divine Retribution
advancements.angel_strike_first.desc=Attack the angel and survive. Foolish but memorable.
